Spec: Todo List Component

Purpose:
  Render the current filtered list of todos as TodoItem components.

Structure:
  ./todo-list.js: Todo list component implementation.

Owns:
  ./todo-list.js

References:
  ./todo-item.sdd

Must:
  Accept a todos array and render one @TodoItem per entry.
  Accept @onToggle and @onRemove callbacks and pass them to each item.
  Re-render the entire list when the todos array changes.
  Display an empty state when the todos array is empty.

Must not:
  Call @TodoService directly.
  Filter or modify the todos array.
  Access localStorage.

Depends on:
  @TodoItem

Exposes:
  @TodoList

Accepts:
  todos: @Todo[]
  @onToggle callback that receives a todo id.
  @onRemove callback that receives a todo id.

Scenario: renders items
  Given a non-empty todos array
  When the list renders
  Then one item element exists per todo

Scenario: empty state
  Given an empty todos array
  When the list renders
  Then an empty-state indicator is shown

Done when:
  Items match the provided todos array length.
  @onToggle and @onRemove propagate to each @TodoItem.
  No service or storage imports exist.
